  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "台文通訊BONG報366期-封面作品：地球阿母"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjbG5PRMX4D6TiT7G0Fm7jqJzhAqwlHLHSHy03HbxIDmsEUyvG23POvCluyVcv6RdFYuLzuORfqylixcaGyE3Tw4PTAap4-nRw3CK_JX19vg2xbY7WgtAGacTiRjUzcuvh_UnKGKyTSCL5nAWS_ZcUSoVVsFeKQ9ybhVYq_1CcNV-IHozGmoDT6k9SEs_VM/s2622/%E6%9E%97%E9%87%87%E9%A2%A8-%E5%9C%B0%E7%90%83%E9%98%BF%E6%AF%8D.tif\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1801\" data-original-width=\"2622\" height=\"440\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjbG5PRMX4D6TiT7G0Fm7jqJzhAqwlHLHSHy03HbxIDmsEUyvG23POvCluyVcv6RdFYuLzuORfqylixcaGyE3Tw4PTAap4-nRw3CK_JX19vg2xbY7WgtAGacTiRjUzcuvh_UnKGKyTSCL5nAWS_ZcUSoVVsFeKQ9ybhVYq_1CcNV-IHozGmoDT6k9SEs_VM/w640-h440/%E6%9E%97%E9%87%87%E9%A2%A8-%E5%9C%B0%E7%90%83%E9%98%BF%E6%AF%8D.tif\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作品名稱</span></b></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">地球阿母</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></b></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作品說明</span></b></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">自佗一冬開始，北極熊mā ài過二十四節氣？</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsîng啥mih時tsūn，囡仔攑頭看bē著北斗七星？</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kám ē記得tang時，lán褪赤跤踏塗踏草接地氣？</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">45億歲ê地球阿母，阮tiānn-tiānn bē記得是你用肩胛頭kā阮sio-thīn，hōo阮thún踏、走tsông、拍拚，感謝你ê包容kah忍耐。現此時，阮ē選擇用無仝款ê方式生活，koh-khah珍惜你ê寶貴。Ǹg望地球上ê所有居民，囝囝孫孫繼續kah美好ê地球阿母sio倚。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: large;\">創作年代</span></b></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">2024年</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: large;\">創作形式</span></b></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">水性色鉛筆、油性粉彩</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></b></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作品寸尺</span></b></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">18x12.5cm</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></b></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作者簡介</span></b></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">林采風，tī台南學甲頂洲大漢--ê。自做阿母以後開始感覺，母語ê傳承是lán ē-sái送hōo囡仔ê禮物，希望未來囡仔ē對tsit phiàn土地有無形ê認同感。</span></div><div style=\"font-size: x-large; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: x-large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjDO3GNqkvxT_vbBsnqnl7cDGrifdurgIOO85gebh02Vx6OrV-4jriiDG0Bil1WwGe3ti_MqrATu3mY_5ylHrPFTmaQrXUbQ1hjG23fNAKYgxXNbr0F94pKb4RLhNZcvF1EaukywPB9PeP9N2xgcFk0N7KX7PcDQWCU3ReJFwwBUr-4mwweryuPX3seCtG-/s1421/366%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"font-size: medium; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1421\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjDO3GNqkvxT_vbBsnqnl7cDGrifdurgIOO85gebh02Vx6OrV-4jriiDG0Bil1WwGe3ti_MqrATu3mY_5ylHrPFTmaQrXUbQ1hjG23fNAKYgxXNbr0F94pKb4RLhNZcvF1EaukywPB9PeP9N2xgcFk0N7KX7PcDQWCU3ReJFwwBUr-4mwweryuPX3seCtG-/w450-h640/366%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a cl